1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,200
Welcome to Caption, a subtitle editor
that runs entirely in your browser.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,100
Open a video file and an .srt file
to get started.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,000
Click any cue to jump the video
to that moment.

4
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,800
Drag the edges of a cue on the timeline
below to adjust its timing.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,200
Short cues like this one get flagged.

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:19,500
This line is intentionally quite long so that it trips the default forty-two character warning threshold.

7
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,000
When you're done, export as .srt or .vtt
from the toolbar above.

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:26,000
That's it — happy editing!
